{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>永子圍棋製作技藝2021年列入國家級非物質文化遺產名錄。如何製作？</p><p></p><p>永子又稱永昌棋，黑白棋子透光，質感獨特，黑子通透似翡翠，白子溫潤如象牙，製作技藝最早可追溯到唐代。但製作一顆小小的圍棋，卻不容易。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_1.J.YN.GO.1020-1104_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NiYmB37XeI1793756224.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>保山永子棋院院長陶曉昌說︰「(永子)用當地的各種寶玉石來滴製。因為他要把這些寶玉石，要1,700多度的高溫才能夠熔煉。所以我們的工人，耐著這麼高的高溫，是一滴一滴地，把這個礦石液體滴在平板上，心手合一而成的。它的大小、厚薄，圓形都是靠師傅耐著高溫純手工(製成)。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_1.J.YN.GO.1020-1104.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202672BDvRYZsC1793756227.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>他說，永子圍棋是中國優秀傳統文化的代表，承載著中華民族的文化自信。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:24:54.374174+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T01:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:19.229075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:18:27.137593+00:00","content_hash":"f69601e986f28d9b091291b3d1fb8faf8c1fb4be8a1f7d0ebc2bdf3c4766ffc6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T02:24:54.374174+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}